>        server (in DCE terms)?

Spawn a thread which does rpc_server_listen().

>        is there a point where my process runs out 
>        of threads? Is 'rpc_c_listen_max_calls_default' that max limit or 

This depends on your implementation, but you should be able to have
dozens, if not hundreds, of threads with no problem.  Don't worry about it.

